        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 9450, 2-3/4\" x 1-1/4\" Adjustable T-Strike</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAdjustable T-Strikes allow you to adjust the latching point of your door hardware. The 2-3/4 inch x 1-1/4 inch Adjustable Strike is great for use where the door is warped or the frame is not level. It is an easy solution to stop a door from rattling because you can get the door to sit tight against the door jam. It is made out of 13 gauge steel and is available in brass or chrome finishes. For use on residential or commercial applications.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-9450-specifications.gif?v=1704354624\" width=\"570\" height=\"226\" border=0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 9450 Adjustable Strike Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/4-7-8-inch-x-1-1-4-inch-adjustable-ansi-t-strike-don-jo-9454\"><b>4-7/8\" x 1-1/4\" Adjustable T-Strike</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Adjustable Strike:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Thickness: 13 gauge (.095)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Optional Brass or Chrome plated.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with 2 piece strike and mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2-3/4 inch x 1-1/4 inch Adjustable Strike, Don-Jo 9450",
                "description": "Don-Jo 9450 2-3/4 inch x 1-1/4 inch Adjustable Strike - Adjustable T-Strikes allow you to adjust the latching point of your door hardware. The 2-3/4 inch x 1-1/4 inch Adjustable Strike is great for use where the door is warped or the frame is not level. It is an easy solution to stop a door from rattling because you can get the door to sit tight against the frame. It is made out of 13 gauge steel and is available in brass or chrome finishes. For use on residential or commercial applications.\r\n",
